  "description": "Angular library for building resizable, dockable panel layouts with split panes, movable tabs, drag & drop, and undo/redo — driven by signals.",
  "author": "Mickael Pezzoni",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/mickael-pezzoni/ngx-dock-layout.git"
  },
